<p><strong>DISINFORMATION CAMPAIGN PROPOSAL 4444-51</strong></p>
<p><strong>Codename:</strong> Star Wars</p>
<p><strong>Proposal:</strong> Produce disinformation that Vice President Gore both believes in and believes he has communicated with a space alien.</p>
<p><strong>Status:</strong> <span style="color: red">Rejected</span> - Due to the sensitive nature of Vice President Gore's anomaly, it was determined that a disinformation campaign so closely linked to the truth would be ill-fated.</p>
