<p><em>The space above the audience begins to distort. SCP-4444’s eyes glow brightly, and suddenly members of the audience start to change shape. SCP-4444 stands, waving its arms above its head.</em></p>
<p><strong>SCP-4444:</strong> Garber unacceptable addition convention terraform unto dark magicianship! Spell! Spell!</p>
